     377.17
    ],
    "block": 4,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Transport connects people and places. It facilitates opportunities and ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     385.87,
     522.8,
     399.34
    ],
    "block": 5,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "helps to create prosperous communities, from city centres to rural areas. ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     398.87,
     537.91,
     412.34
    ],
    "block": 5,
    "line": 1,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "The sector also has a key role to play in achieving our climate change ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     411.87,
     521.51,
     425.34
    ],
    "block": 5,
    "line": 2,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "targets and mitigating the worst effects of climate breakdown. The ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     424.87,
     512.16,
     438.34
    ],
    "block": 5,
    "line": 3,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "National Investment Framework for Transport in Ireland (NIFTI) has been ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     437.87,
     539.11,
     451.34
    ],
    "block": 5,
    "line": 4,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "developed with these relationships in mind.",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     450.87,
     408.86,
     464.34
    ],
    "block": 5,
    "line": 5,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "NIFTI is the Department of Transport’s high-level, strategic framework ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     472.38,
     528.43,
     485.85
    ],
    "block": 6,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "for future investment in the land transport network. Its purpose is to ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     485.38,
     520.87,
     498.85
    ],
    "block": 6,
    "line": 1,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "guide the development of the transport network in the decades ahead ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     498.38,
     528.47,
     511.85
    ],
    "block": 6,
    "line": 2,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "to enable the National Planning Framework and promote positive social, ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     511.38,
     536.69,
     524.85
    ],
    "block": 6,
    "line": 3,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "environmental and economic outcomes throughout the country. A number ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     524.38,
     546.37,
     537.85
    ],
    "block": 6,
    "line": 4,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "of key challenges in relation to transport investment have been identified ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     537.38,
     540.84,
     550.85
    ],
    "block": 6,
    "line": 5,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "and our strategic Investment Priorities are designed to address them.",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     550.38,
     520.14,
     563.85
    ],
    "block": 6,
    "line": 6,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "The following section outlines why investment in transport is important ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
