    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": " Investing in Transport",
    "font": "Lato-Bold",
    "size": 17.0,
    "bbox": [
     267.02,
     619.81,
     434.33,
     643.36
    ],
    "block": 8,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Investment in transport is never for its own sake. The goal of transport is ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     652.06,
     538.15,
     665.53
    ],
    "block": 9,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "not the construction of a new railway line, for example, but to facilitate all ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     665.06,
     543.56,
     678.53
    ],
    "block": 9,
    "line": 1,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "the benefits which that piece of infrastructure will bring by allowing for ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     678.06,
     531.73,
     691.53
    ],
    "block": 9,
    "line": 2,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "the movement of people and goods.",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     691.06,
     376.91,
     704.53
    ],
    "block": 9,
    "line": 3,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Transport supports liveable communities and connects families and ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     712.56,
     514.63,
     726.03
    ],
    "block": 10,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "friends. Investing in transport allows people to travel around the ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     725.56,
     502.41,
     739.03
    ],
    "block": 10,
    "line": 1,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "island, accessing amenities, employment and key public services such ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     738.56,
     523.35,
     752.03
    ],
    "block": 10,
    "line": 2,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "as healthcare and education. The right transport investment promotes ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     219.43,
     751.56,
