    "line": 0,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": " Introduction",
    "font": "Lato-Bold",
    "size": 17.0,
    "bbox": [
     267.74,
     386.95,
     366.13,
     410.49
    ],
    "block": 3,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "The National Planning Framework has set out the vision for the ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     419.2,
     498.61,
     432.67
    ],
    "block": 4,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "sustainable development of Irish society over the coming decades, a vision ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     432.2,
     546.83,
     445.67
    ],
    "block": 4,
    "line": 1,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "encapsulated by the ten NSOs. Transport has a key role to play in realising ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     445.2,
     544.6,
     458.67
    ],
    "block": 4,
    "line": 2,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "this vision.",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     458.2,
     266.27,
     471.67
    ],
    "block": 4,
    "line": 3,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "NIFTI ensures that transport investment is aligned with the NSOs and ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     479.7,
     527.03,
     493.17
    ],
    "block": 5,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "supports, enables and facilitates the NPF, delivering positive social, ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     492.7,
     514.55,
     506.17
    ],
    "block": 5,
    "line": 1,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "environmental and economic outcomes throughout Ireland.",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     505.7,
     479.11,
     519.17
    ],
    "block": 5,
    "line": 2,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "The following section articulates our high-level objectives when we invest ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     527.2,
     545.06,
     540.67
    ],
    "block": 6,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "in transport and how this investment relates to the ten NSOs.",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     540.2,
     488.82,
     553.67
    ],
    "block": 6,
    "line": 1,
    "span": 0
   },
