     575.14,
     537.57,
     598.68
    ],
    "block": 7,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "In the coming decades, we will invest to deliver a safe and sustainable ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     607.38,
     526.34,
     620.85
    ],
    "block": 8,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "land transport network which supports prosperous communities, ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     620.38,
     505.33,
     633.85
    ],
    "block": 8,
    "line": 1,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "promotes balanced development and helps to realise our climate change ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     633.38,
     537.94,
     646.85
    ],
    "block": 8,
    "line": 2,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "goals.",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     646.38,
     244.97,
     659.85
    ],
    "block": 8,
    "line": 3,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "There will be an estimated one million more people living in Ireland in ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     667.89,
     525.34,
     681.36
    ],
    "block": 9,
    "line": 0,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "2040 when compared to 2018. The NPF has set specific targets for ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     680.89,
     515.58,
     694.36
    ],
    "block": 9,
    "line": 1,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "where this population will live and work, and transport has a key enabling ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
