     706.89,
     536.13,
     720.36
    ],
    "block": 9,
    "line": 3,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "infrastructure and services in our cities and towns, transport can help ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
