     719.89,
     524.91,
     733.36
    ],
    "block": 9,
    "line": 4,
    "span": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "realise compact growth and the decarbonisation of the transport sector. ",
    "font": "Lato-Regular",
    "size": 10.0,
    "bbox": [
     220.16,
     732.89,
     536.42,
     746.36
    ],
    "block": 9,
    "line": 5,
